# Project open / cold start (mandatory)

Living docs: [`docs/terminals.md`](../../docs/terminals.md) (Persistence →
Project open / cold start),
[`openspec/specs/terminals/projects/spec.md`](../../openspec/specs/terminals/projects/spec.md).

When opening or restoring a Project (File → Projects or last Project on
startup), **same on Linux and Windows**:

1. **Terminal tab** — every restored **live** TERMINALS session selects the
   primary Terminal tab (`active_view == 0`), even if YAML saved a filter tab.
   Do **not** leave the user on an empty filter tab after open.
2. **Auto-start** — start without pressing Start: saved `command` → process;
   no command → interactive shell; FILES → begin load.
3. Empty viewport “Press Start” hints are fallback copy only, not the open path.

Do not “fix” Project open by restoring the last filter tab or leaving
sessions stopped for the user to click Start.
